<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  A clean UBL 2.1 invoice in the shape an ERP exports for Peppol BIS Billing
  3.0 / XRechnung UBL: two VAT rates on one invoice, a checksum-valid seller
  VAT ID and buyer GLN, an IBAN with the remittance reference to quote, and a
  part payment already received.

  Line 1   2 x 100.00           = 200.00   S 19%
  Line 2   3 x  50.00           = 150.00   S  7%
  Line total / tax-exclusive      350.00
  VAT   S 19% on 200.00            38.00
  VAT   S  7% on 150.00            10.50
  Tax-inclusive                   398.50
  Prepaid                         -98.50
  Due                             300.00

  A document-level discount is deliberately not exercised here: the checker
  currently applies header allowances to the net total but not to the VAT
  breakdown, so such an invoice would be reported as defective when it is not.
  See the PR discussion; this fixture stays clean until that is closed.
-->
